        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: The Hunchback of Notre Dame (1996 film), Saludos Amigos, I Panayia Ton Parision\n- People: Sakis Rouvas\n- Companies: Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures, Walt Disney, RKO Radio Pictures\n- Topics: film production, release, dubbing, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Saludos Amigos is a 1942 American live-action animated package film produced by Walt Disney and released by RKO Radio Pictures.\n- The Hunchback of Notre Dame is a 1996 American animated musical drama film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- In 1996, Sakis Rouvas began his cinematographic work by voicing Quasimodo in the Greek-language dubbing of Disney's The Hunchback of Notre Dame, titled I Panayia Ton Parision.",
